---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

import avatarImg from "../assets/images/avatar.png";
---

<Layout
  title="About Me - 6gh.dev"
  description="Learn more about 6gh, the creator of 6gh.dev, and what he does!"
  path="about"
>
  <main
    class="content-container w-full py-4 font-body"
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 w-full items-center">
      <Image
        class="rounded-full w-32 h-32"
        src={avatarImg}
        alt="6gh's profile picture"
      />
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">
          6gh
        </h1>
        <h2 class="text-base opacity-60 italic">
          Web Developer, Programmer, Black MIDI Enthusiast, FOSS Advocate, Arch Linux User (btw)
        </h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p>
      <!-- generated by github copilot as placeholder -->
      Hi! I'm 6gh. I'm also a fan of black MIDI music, which is a genre of music that focuses on creating music with an absurdly high number of notes. I'm also a big fan of free and open-source software (FOSS) and use Arch Linux as my daily driver. I'm always looking for new projects to work on and new things to learn, so feel free to reach out to me if you have any ideas or projects you'd like to collaborate on!
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>

